function finishingPDSectionControl(readonly=false){const values=[...new Set(['1','2','3','4',...finishingPDRecords().map(row=>finishingPDTable(row.hourlyPD.fields))])];return finishingPDInput(finishingPDDraft.fields.section,'id="finishing-pd-section" data-finishing-pd-field="section" maxlength="120" list="finishing-pd-table-options"',readonly)+'<datalist id="finishing-pd-table-options">'+values.map(value=>'<option value="'+esc(value)+'"></option>').join('')+'</datalist>';}
const finishingPDSupervisors={};
function finishingPDApplySupervisor(fields=finishingPDDraft.fields,clear=false){const name=finishingPDSupervisors[finishingPDSection(fields.section)];if(name!==undefined)fields.incharge=name;else if(clear)fields.incharge='';return fields.incharge||'';}
